  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4707dfafe0a0e10f8a7987394aaa9c16d8e4bf81" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.324ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle Y_{r}}"/></span>, when the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Characteristic_(algebra)" title="Characteristic (algebra)" id="mwjQ">characteristic</a> of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Field_(mathematics)" title="Field (mathematics)" id="mwjg">field</a> is zero, was solved by <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alain_Lascoux" title="Alain Lascoux" id="mwjw">Alain Lascoux</a>, using the natural action of<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwkA"> </span><i id="mwkQ">G</i>.</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwkg" aria-labelledby="Related_topics"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Related_topics">Related topics</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Determinantal_variety&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Related topics"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<p id="mwkw">One can "globalize" the notion of determinantal varieties by considering the space of linear maps between two vector bundles on an algebraic variety. Then the determinantal varieties fall into the general study of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Degeneracy_loci" title="Degeneracy loci" class="mw-redirect" id="mwlA">degeneracy loci</a>. An expression for the cohomology class of these degeneracy loci is given by the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thom-Porteous_formula" title="Thom-Porteous formula" class="mw-redirect" id="mwlQ">Thom-Porteous formula</a>, see (Fulton-Pragacz).</p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="4" id="mwlg" aria-labelledby="References"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="References">References</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Determinantal_variety&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4" title="Edit section: References"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
